// The generator conformance package: the wire `core/codegen` speaks, driven
// through `run` with a stdin and a stdout double rather than around it.
//
// The assertions are on the *document*, byte for byte, because the other end
// of this wire is `cli/src/build/generators.rs` — a Rust parser that admits
// objects, arrays, strings, non-negative integers and `null`, and nothing
// else. A round trip against ourselves would pass just as happily if both
// halves drifted together.
